---
title: The OG Smoothie
servings: 5
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
---

Blend together @banana{1½}(frozen), @mixed berries{1%handful}(frozen), @?oatmeal{¼%cup}(old-fashioned oats), @honey{dash}, @?vanilla protein powder{2%scoops}, @?strawberry protein powder{1%scoop}, @liquids{4%cups}(Costco Almond Milk is perfect for this, but a blend of Orange Juice, any milk, or water works), @peanut butter{1-2%tbsp}(heaping), @?orange Emergen-C packets{3}, and @?multi-vitamins{3}(blended) until smooth.

> This is very much a throw together whatever you have/like type recipe, but it's our go-to choices.